sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as Investor
    participant UI as Web App
    participant PC as PortfolioController
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant PG as PaymentGateway
    participant IS as InvestmentService
    participant MD as MarketDataProvider
    participant DB as Database
    I->>UI: Accept plan (choose auto-invest: monthly)
    UI->>PC: POST /recommendations/{id}/accept
    PC->>DB: Load Recommendation and Wallet
    alt Wallet balance is lower than the plan total
        PC-->>UI: 402 Fund wallet first
        UI->>I: Show funding screen
        I->>UI: Enter amount
        UI->>WS: startFunding(wallet, amount)
        WS->>PG: initialize(amount, email)
        PG-->>WS: PaymentSession (checkout link)
        WS-->>UI: Checkout link
        I->>PG: Pay on gateway page
        PG-->>WS: Webhook: charge.success(reference)
        WS->>PG: verify(reference)
        PG-->>WS: PaymentResult (success)
        WS->>DB: Credit wallet, save Transaction (SETTLED)
        UI->>PC: Retry accept
    end
    PC->>DB: Create Portfolio with target weights
    loop For each RecommendedItem
        PC->>IS: buy(portfolio, asset, amount)
        IS->>MD: getPrice(symbol)
        MD-->>IS: price
        IS->>WS: debit(wallet, amount)
        IS->>DB: Save Holding and Transaction (BUY, SETTLED)
    end
    opt Investor chose auto-invest
        PC->>DB: Create InvestPlan (ACTIVE, nextRun)
    end
    PC->>DB: Mark Recommendation ACCEPTED
    PC-->>UI: 201 Portfolio created
    UI-->>I: Show portfolio dashboard
